          },
          "text": "Work in progress, but this is so fucking cool I just have to share..\n\nI'm moving the entire CSS pipeline off the main thread in @ladybirdbrowser. This allows us to animate any CSS properties we want and they just keep going smoothly despite heavy JS execution!\n\nVideo demo is animating a bunch of flex and grid layouts while JS churns on the main thread. Same demo in Chrome for comparison.\n\nWelcome to the future, bros 😎"
        },
